<p style=3D"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><font style=
=3D"font-family:Times New Roman" size=3D"2">9.18 <u>Section&nbsp;1031 Excha=
nge</u>. Either party may consummate the purchase or sale of the Property a=
s part of a so-called like kind
exchange (an =93Exchange=94) pursuant to section&nbsp;1031 of the Internal =
Revenue Code of 1986, as amended (the =93Code=94), provided that (i)&nbsp;t=
he Closing shall not be delayed or affected by reason of an Exchange nor sh=
all the
consummation or accomplishment of any Exchange be a condition precedent or =
condition subsequent to a party=92s obligations under this Agreement; (ii)&=
nbsp;any party desiring an Exchange shall effect its Exchange through an as=
signment of this
Agreement, or its rights under this Agreement, to a qualified intermediary =
and the other party shall not be required to take an assignment of the purc=
hase agreement for the relinquished or replacement property or be required =
to acquire or hold title
to any real property for purposes of consummating such Exchange; and (iii)&=
nbsp;the party desiring an Exchange shall pay any additional costs that wou=
ld not otherwise have been incurred by Buyer or Seller had such party not c=
onsummated its purchase
or sale through an Exchange. Neither party shall by this agreement or acqui=
escence to an Exchange desired by the other party (1)&nbsp;have its rights =
under this Agreement affected or diminished in any manner or (2)&nbsp;be re=
sponsible for compliance
with or be deemed to have warranted to the other party that such party=92s =
Exchange in fact complies with section&nbsp;1031 of the Code. In connection=
 with such cooperation, Seller agrees, upon request of Buyer to =93direct d=
eed=94 for
actual interests in the property to designees of Buyer. </font></p> <p styl=
e=3D"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><font style=3D"font=
-family:Times New Roman" size=3D"2">9.19 <u>Rule 3-14 Audit and SEC Filing =
Requirements</u>. Subsequent
to the Closing Date and no later than one (1)&nbsp;calendar year subsequent=
